{"id":"n31790-1-7","stage":4,"title":"제비 · 燕子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31790-1-7-1","ko":"아침부터 마당에서 제비가 우네요.","zh":"从早上开始，院子里就有燕子在鸣叫呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침부터","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침부터","audio":"/audio/27684d1037b9a47f708d.mp3"}},{"text":"마당에서","meaning":"院子，庭院","explanation":"마당：院子，庭院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"마당","audio":"/audio/bcf71a239bbaaf8d1e52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15687","senseId":"1","lemma":"마당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마당에서","audio":"/audio/7ba37cdacd9d84b7d797.mp3"}},{"text":"제비가","meaning":"燕子","explanation":"제비：燕子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"제비","audio":"/audio/2f40281eb74647249b81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31790","senseId":"1","lemma":"제비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제비가","audio":"/audio/a8358651c6bf0894640a.mp3"}},{"text":"우네요.","meaning":"啼，鸣，嚎叫","explanation":"울다：啼，鸣，嚎叫；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"2","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우네요","audio":"/audio/ecbaa1d96a70be298f73.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"bcf71a239bbaaf8d","term":"마당","zh":"院子，庭院","audio":"/audio/bcf71a239bbaaf8d1e52.mp3","entryId":"15687","definition":"房子附带着的平整的空地。","pronunciation":["마당"]},{"id":"2f40281eb7464724","term":"제비","zh":"燕子","audio":"/audio/2f40281eb74647249b81.mp3","entryId":"31790","definition":"一种飞行速度极快的小型夏季候鸟，背部为黑色，肚子是白色，春天飞来韩国，冬天飞向南方。","pronunciation":["제ː비"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"啼，鸣，嚎叫","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"动物、昆虫、风等发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/53a70ae521a946708157.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31790-1-7-2","ko":"오늘 반가운 손님이 오시려나 보구나.","zh":"看来今天会有位令人高兴的客人要来啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"반가운","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반가운","audio":"/audio/41577050778e2a99996a.mp3"}},{"text":"손님이","meaning":"客，客人","explanation":"손님：客，客人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"1","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손님이","audio":"/audio/8d63bf2c15d65035a7d2.mp3"}},{"text":"오시려나","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；려나：表示对未来情况的疑问或推测。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오시려나","audio":"/audio/2715cf703c77ac342f37.mp3"}},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보구나","audio":"/audio/63677854531485540e78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客，客人","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)从其他地方来的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/61e5f4c38589624ccc8c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31790","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":122,"sequenceScore":1.9013,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来今天会有位令人高兴的客人要来啊。","你说你在和比你年轻的人交往？是真的吗？","从早上开始，院子里就有燕子在鸣叫呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来今天会有位令人高兴的客人要来啊。","从早上开始，院子里就有燕子在鸣叫呢。","你说你在和比你年轻的人交往？是真的吗？"],"answer":0}]}
